    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Madcap Meks",
    "summary": "In your Shooting phase, roll one D6 when a single enemy takes all the ranged targeting from a friendly MORKANAUT, WAZBOM BLASTAJET, BIG MEK or MEK GUNZ unit. On 1, Dat’s Weird gives the target 4+ InSv. On 2–3, For Hop Splat, pick a different enemy within 3\" of that target. Deal D3 Mortal Wounds to the chosen unit. On 4, Seekerz gives those attacks +1 on Hit rolls. On 5, Lifted gives the target FLY and strips its Benefit of Cover. On 6, Runtified gives the target −1 T. Results 1, 5 and 6 last until the firing unit finishes shooting.",
